cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Project BioNeural research in your work, please cite it as follows."
title: "Project BioNeural: A Biomimetic Head with an Autonomous Hybrid Brain"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A fully simulated biomimetic head with an autonomous hybrid brain uniting classical deep neural
  networks with the operational principles of the human brain (continuous-time spiking neural
  networks and limbic/subcortical loops). Embodied with stereoscopic foveated vision, binaural sound
  localization, physical articulatory vocal synthesis, and 18-DOF kinematics with vestibulo-ocular
  reflex. Runs sovereign, offline, on entry-level commodity hardware (RAM < 4 GB, single-core
  2.0 GHz CPU, zero GPU, < 50 MB active footprint) within a < 15 W envelope.
